      <div class="mt-8 p-5 bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200 rounded-xl text-center">
        <p class="text-xs text-stone-500">Researched & written by Li Wei, MA in Chinese Art History · Fact-checked against academic and museum sources · Published August 6, 2026 · <a href="/about" class="text-[#b5343a] hover:underline">About the author</a></p>
      </div>

    </div>
